18	 * the old slot, both fill-path fixes:
19	 * - `updateQuestionnaireResponseCB` is memoized — ChargeItemQuestion lists
20	 *   it in an effect dependency array, so a fresh inline arrow per render is
21	 *   a real loop hazard.
22	 * - fill mode passes `questionnaireId`/`questionnaireSlug` so
23	 *   MedicationRequest/ServiceRequest response-template sheets work; preview
24	 *   deliberately withholds them, keeping template CRUD (real POSTs) off the
